---
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import { siteConfig } from '../lib/siteConfig';

/**
 * Terms of use (§6, Phase C7; launch form 2026-08-04). Claims-safe
 * lexicon: the standard vocabulary that would trip lint:claims is
 * deliberately absent. Counsel reviews post-launch (operator
 * acceptance, DECISIONS 2026-08-04).
 */
---

<LegalLayout
  heading="Terms of Use"
  title="Terms of Use | Needle Girlie"
  description="Terms of use for needlegirlie.com."
>
  <p>
    Welcome to needlegirlie.com, the website of Needle Girlie, the
    practice of Amy Palacios, FNP. By using this website, you accept
    these terms.
  </p>

  <h2>Information only</h2>
  <p>
    This website exists to describe the practice and its services and to
    route visitors to booking. Nothing on it is medical advice, and
    reading it does not create a provider–patient relationship with Amy
    Palacios, FNP. Clinical decisions happen in consultation, never on a
    website. If you are experiencing a medical emergency, call 911.
  </p>

  <h2>Using this website</h2>
  <p>
    This website may be used for reading about the practice, booking
    through the links provided, and contacting the practice. Attempting
    to disrupt the website, scrape or republish its content at scale, or
    otherwise misuse it is not permitted.
  </p>

  <h2>Booking happens elsewhere</h2>
  <p>
    Appointments are scheduled through Vagaro, a third-party service with
    its own terms. Needle Girlie does not operate Vagaro and is not
    responsible for it, or for any other external site this website
    links to.
  </p>

  <h2>Content and branding</h2>
  <p>
    The content, photography, wordmark, and branding on this website
    belong to Needle Girlie and may not be reused without written
    permission. Product and device names mentioned on this website — for
    example Jeuveau, Evolysse, Biote, Evolve, Venus Versa Pro, PiXel8-RF,
    Radiesse, and Skinbetter Science — belong to their respective
    manufacturers.
  </p>

  <h2>No warranties</h2>
  <p>
    This website is provided as is, without warranties of any kind.
    Content may change or contain errors; Needle Girlie may update or
    remove any part of it at any time.
  </p>

  <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
  <p>
    To the fullest extent the law allows, Needle Girlie and Amy
    Palacios, FNP, are not liable for losses arising from the use of
    this website or from reliance on its content. Nothing on this
    website is individual clinical advice; see the
    <a href="/medical-disclaimer">Medical Disclaimer</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Governing law</h2>
  <p>
    These terms are governed by the laws of the State of North Carolina.
  </p>

  <h2>Severability</h2>
  <p>
    If any part of these terms is found unenforceable, the remaining
    parts stay in effect.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes to these terms</h2>
  <p>
    These terms may be updated from time to time; the version posted
    here, with its effective date, is the one in force.
  </p>

  <h2>Questions</h2>
  <p>
    Questions about these terms can be directed to Needle Girlie by
    phone at <a href={siteConfig.phoneTel}>{siteConfig.phone}</a>.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
